[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a Directory Traversal vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the application accepts a user-supplied directory path as a query parameter without adequate validation or restrictions. If the input is not properly sanitized, an attacker could manipulate the directory parameter to access files outside the intended directory structure, potentially exposing sensitive files or data on the server. This occurs when the application fails to enforce strict boundaries on file system access, allowing unauthorized file retrieval through crafted input.

